WEBVTT

00:13:56.456 --> 00:14:01.670
So these innovators, these guys,

00:14:01.712 --> 00:14:05.507
these rock stars
who have taken on everything

00:14:05.549 --> 00:14:09.011
from computing, to commerce, to coffee --

00:14:09.052 --> 00:14:12.347
wouldn't it be cool
to see them disrupt inequity too?

00:14:12.931 --> 00:14:14.766
To look at the world the way it is,

00:14:14.766 --> 00:14:17.769
just like Gareth and John did,

00:14:17.811 --> 00:14:19.563
and say to themselves,

00:14:19.605 --> 00:14:21.273
"Nah, that's not it."

00:14:22.149 --> 00:14:23.817
I don't know about you,

00:14:23.817 --> 00:14:27.195
but those are the kind
of rock stars I want to see.

00:14:27.195 --> 00:14:28.447
Thank you.

00:14:28.488 --> 00:14:31.909
(Cheers and applause)